'''Flowerwood Gun''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Flowerwood Gun Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or the [[Flowerwood Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Easter Event 2024]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It takes a similiar shape and design to [[Hallowgun]]. The handle is a dark blue with blue vines going all around it and some flowers visible aswell. Its overall colors vary from dark blue to light blue, with a dark blue-light blue barrel and a violet cylinder. Lastly, the trigger is dark blue. 

== Trivia ==
* It has a partner knife under the name [[Flowerwood]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Flowerwood_Set Flowerwood Set].
* This and its partner knife are two of the eight gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy them as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Darkshot]], [[Darksword]], [[Waves]], [[Ocean]], [[Rainbow (Godly)|Rainbow]], [[Rainbow Gun (Godly)|Rainbow Gun]], [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]].

